                  <zone forceUpdate='true' h='23100' id='1862' type-v2='text' w='51704' x='296' y='13200'>
                    <formatted-text>
                      <run fontcolor='#32374b' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Use the drop-down menus to compare different project outcomes.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#32374b' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Resilience project metrics for an asset can be compared by switching between projects in the menu.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#32374b' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Network links can be symbolized by: (1) overall resilience project regret ranking, (2) resilience project costs across the period of analysis, (3) average link exposure across all hazards in the scenario space.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#32374b' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Spatial data are taken from the user-provided true shapes input file. If not provided, this dashboard will be blank.</run>
