                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10' underline='true'>Total</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> - risk-weighted sum across hazard events.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10' underline='true'>Resiliency Projects</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> - raising a road, bridge scour protection, seawall barrier, etc.</run>
