                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='37' forceUpdate='true' h='6400' id='12' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='6400'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#32374b' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='14' italic='true'>Dashboard Guide and Navigation</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='14' italic='true'>[            ]</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='68100' hidden-by-user='true' id='274' type-v2='text' w='25185' x='74148' y='7700'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10' underline='true'>Dam.</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10' italic='true'>(Damage)</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> - system performance of the network when the asset is damaged and under repair and after the exposure has ended.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10' underline='true'>Exp.</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10' italic='true'>(Exposure)</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> - system performance of the network when the exposure event is occuring.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10' underline='true'>Init.</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10' italic='true'>(Initial)</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> - system performance of the network for a single day at the highest level of exposure event. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10' underline='true'>Total</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> - risk-weighted sum across hazard events.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10' underline='true'>Resiliency Projects</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> - raising a road, bridge scour protection, seawall barrier, etc.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10' underline='true'>Assets</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> - bridges, roads, tunnels.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10' underline='true'>Asset-Projects</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> - a specific resiliency project applied to a specific asset.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10' underline='true'>Scenarios: </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Æ      </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='arial unicode ms,Lucida Sans Unicode,sans-serif' fontsize='10'>•</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'> Exposure</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Æ               </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='arial unicode ms,Lucida Sans Unicode,sans-serif' fontsize='10'>•</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> Initial Flood Depth (ft.), Flood </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>                  Duration (days), etc.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Æ      </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='arial unicode ms,Lucida Sans Unicode,sans-serif' fontsize='10'>•</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'> Future Conditions</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Æ               </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='arial unicode ms,Lucida Sans Unicode,sans-serif' fontsize='10'>•</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> Economic Scenario (e.g. may </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>                  determine trip levels and locations).</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Æ               </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='arial unicode ms,Lucida Sans Unicode,sans-serif' fontsize='10'>•</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> Trip Loss (e.g. how trips may change </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>                   as a result of changes to network </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>                   capacity).</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10' underline='true'>Asset-Project Scenario</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> - the specific outcome that results from testing a </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10' italic='true'>resiliency project</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> deployed on a specific </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10' italic='true'>asset</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> in a specific </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10' italic='true'>scenario</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>For descriptions of all of the metrics found in the Tableau dashboard, refer to the Technical Documentation.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='44100' hidden-by-user='true' id='277' type-v2='text' w='24667' x='74444' y='7700'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#32374b' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='15' underline='true'>How To Use the Dashboard</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#32374b' fontname='arial unicode ms,Lucida Sans Unicode,sans-serif' fontsize='11'>•</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#32374b' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> The marks are symbolized based on the resiliency</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#32374b' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>   project&apos;s regret ranking.  Orange marks have a </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#32374b' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>   lower (better) regret ranking, and blue marks have</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#32374b' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>   a higher (worse) regret ranking.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#32374b' fontname='arial unicode ms,Lucida Sans Unicode,sans-serif' fontsize='11'>•</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#32374b' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> To view all marks for a specific resiliency project,</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#32374b' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>   click on the project in the table to highlight all </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#32374b' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>   marks across the dashboard.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#32374b' fontname='arial unicode ms,Lucida Sans Unicode,sans-serif' fontsize='11'>•</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#32374b' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> To view minimum/maximum of filter ranges, hover</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#32374b' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>   over the filter text box in the Filter Panel.  </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#32374b' fontname='arial unicode ms,Lucida Sans Unicode,sans-serif' fontsize='11'>•</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#32374b' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> To reset all filters, click the &quot;Revert Filters&quot;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#32374b' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>   button on the banner.  Allow 10-15 seconds after</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#32374b' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>   resetting the filters before applying new filters.  </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#32374b' fontname='arial unicode ms,Lucida Sans Unicode,sans-serif' fontsize='11'>•</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#32374b' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> To view a list of relevant terms and defintions, </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#32374b' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>   click the dictionary icon on the banner.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#424242' fontname='arial unicode ms,Lucida Sans Unicode,sans-serif' fontsize='11'>•</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#424242' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> To view details about a data point, hover over the</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#424242' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>   data point to reveal a tooltip pop-up.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='4600' id='2135' type-v2='text' w='70148' x='2963' y='13200'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#32374b' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='14'>Navigation</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='4600' id='2145' type-v2='text' w='24815' x='74889' y='13200'>
